OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champion Graeme Dott
OL,4,Aguilty of child abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world snooker champion Graeme
OL,7,FDott has been found guilty of child
OL,8,Fabuse.
OL,10,FJurors at the High Court in Glasgow
OL,11,Ffound the 49-year-old guilty of two
OL,12,Fcharges of lewd and libidinous
OL,13,Fbehaviour towards a girl and boy
OL,14,Fbetween 1993 and 2010.
OL,16,FThis breaking news story is being
OL,17,Fupdated and more details will be
OL,18,Fpublished shortly. Please refresh the
OL,19,Fpage for the fullest version.
